{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My little Cafe Nightmare is a spine-chilling but kind of cushy ego-simulation game in which you serve coffee like hot drinks to all kinds of creatures of the night and create a cozy and peacefull spot to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/MLCN_EnterCafe.gif?t=1747935877\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/MLCN_ShopInfo_Label_TheCafe_ENG.png?t=1747935877\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The former guests are tired of the rotten and run down look of this old cafe. Redesign the shop, keep it clean and make it a place where all sorts of creatures feel comfortable at.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/MLCN_EnterCafeEgo.gif?t=1747935877\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/MLCN_ShopInfo_Label_Brewing_ENG.png?t=1747935877\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your main task will be to brew a good coffee with all kinds of flavours because your guests have there own special tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/MLCN_BrewCoffee.gif?t=1747935877\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/MLCN_ShopInfo_Label_Logistics_ENG.png?t=1747935877\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always keep track of your Ingredients and amount of cups you 